<h3>From Classroom to Career: Launching tCAP</h3>
<h5>Building Connections. Creating Opportunities. Preparing Future Innovators.</h5>
<p>Join Bellini College for the launch of <strong>tCAP (Tech Career Advancement Program)</strong> and discover how this new initiative will help you connect with industry professionals, gain real-world experience, and prepare for a successful career in technology.&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;Morning refreshments and lunch will be provided.&nbsp;</p>
<h3>EVENT DETAILS</h3>
<p><strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;">Monday, October 12, 2026</strong><br style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;" /><strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;">Check-In:</strong><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 16px;">9:30 a.m.</span><br style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;" /><strong style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;">Program:</strong><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 16px;">10:00 a.m.&ndash;1:00 p.m.</span></p>
<p><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Judy Genshaft Building (HON)</span><br style="font-size: 16px;" /><span style="font-size: 16px;">12260 USF Genshaft Drive</span><br style="font-size: 16px;" /><span style="font-size: 16px;">Tampa, FL 33620</span></span></p>
<table class="button-link-snippet" style="width: 100%;">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" colspan="2">Button - Left</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" width="50%">Edit button link:</th>
<td width="50%"><a style="text-underline-offset: 4px; font-size: 16px;" href="https://usf.az1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_8As4nnvvodX8qsC">Register Now!</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h4>Registration is required to attend!</h4>
<h4>Please register by <strong>October 5</strong> to reserve your seat.</h4>
<h3>WHAT YOU&rsquo;LL GAIN</h3>
<p>Through tCAP, you&rsquo;ll discover opportunities to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Explore internship and job opportunities</li>
<li>Build connections with employers and Bellini College alumni</li>
<li>Receive career guidance and mentoring</li>
<li>Gain hands-on, real-world experience</li>
</ul>
<h3>WHO SHOULD ATTEND</h3>
<p>All undergraduate students in Bellini College interested in careers in AI, cybersecurity, and computing. Whether you&rsquo;re just beginning your college journey or preparing to enter the workforce, tCAP is designed to help you move from classroom to career.</p>
<p>All class levels are welcome!</p>
<h3>WHAT TO EXPECT</h3>
<p>Join us for an engaging afternoon featuring interactive sessions, networking, and opportunities to connect with employers, alumni, mentors, faculty, and staff.</p>
<h3>PARKING</h3>
<p>Complimentary event parking is available for registered guests. Please park in <strong>Lot 22D or 22E</strong>. Please follow the event parking signage.</p>
<p>Please visit USF Parking &amp; Transportation Services for more parking information and the campus parking map.</p>
<p><a href="/parking/parking/visitor-parking.aspx?utm_source=chatgpt.com">USF Visitor Parking Information</a><br /><a href="/parking/maps/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">USF Campus Parking Maps</a></p>
<h3>BE PART OF THE LAUNCH</h3>
<p>Be among the first students to experience <strong>tCAP</strong> and discover how this new initiative can help you build connections, gain experience, and accelerate your career.</p>
<p><strong>Your event hub is just a click away.</strong> Bookmark this page for the latest agenda, logistics, parking information, and event announcements as October 12 approaches.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p><!-- /com.omniupdate.div -->
</maincontent>

